From 4bc02b6926e3eededcb2fa146b7700034c6ce7a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 05:22:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Priorities: PrioritiesPage container and
 PrioritiesPageContext replace PrioritiesScreen and PriorityMatrixPage

The route runs toPrioritiesPageProps (the no-plan periodKey fallback) and
renders PrioritiesPage, which now renders BoardHeader itself and provides
activePlanId, the open popover and its writes through PrioritiesPageContext.
QuadrantCell, MatrixTaskCard, MoveToPopover, MoveToRows, MobileMoveToSheet
and MobileMoveToPanel take data only. groupTasksByQuadrant and isTrackedTask
move to oneOffUtils with unit tests. The Design Console renders the
container and wraps specimens in inertPrioritiesPageContext.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KCt6pMxatw9JrN3TasCRUY
